# On-Call Reference

## When Paged
1. Acknowledge alert
2. Assess severity
3. Start incident (if SEV1/2)
4. Investigate & mitigate
5. Document

## Escalate When
- Cannot resolve in 30 min
- Need domain expertise
- Multiple systems affected

